WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:10.950
Excuse me!

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.190
…Excuse me!...No...

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:14.870
Always busy in here on a Friday night!

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:15.870
Sorry!

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:16.870
Could I just have a...

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:18.240
Patience and persistence!

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.240
Ahh, finally.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:23.110
Yes, erm ok, I’d like a beer, please!

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:24.110
Sorry?

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:25.110
what kind?

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:26.110
Of beer?

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:27.110
Erm, lager, please.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.360
Yeah, that'll do.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:30.080
Sorry, what?

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:31.650
A half pint or a pint?

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:34.300
How big is a pint?

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.300
Yes.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:36.300
OK, a pint.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.000
Ok, great, I’d like a...

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Oh, sorry.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.800
Two pints of lager, please.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:42.160
OK great, I’ll have...

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:44.300
Oh…and a packet of crisps.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.030
Sorry.

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:47.030
What flavour?

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.589
Erm, let me just check.

00:00:48.589 --> 00:00:50.379
What flavour?

00:00:50.379 --> 00:00:52.050
Cheese and onion.

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:53.050
OK give me...

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:54.350
And a glass of wine.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:55.350
Red, please.

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:57.100
Yes, I’m sure that’s it.

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:58.100
Thank you.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:00:59.100
How much is that?

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.729
Let me just check my wallet.

00:01:00.729 --> 00:01:05.970
I’ve got five, and that’s another six.

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:09.850
OK great, I’d like a pint of bitter and
two halves of lager please.

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:10.850
Cheers. Keep the change.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.000
That’s how it's done!

